<title>BELGIUM: Gevaert sees higher 1996 earnings.</title>
<headline>Gevaert sees higher 1996 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian holding company Gevaert said it expected full year 1996 consolidated profit to be higher than in 1995.</p>
<p>&quot;The group's profit for the full year 1996 is expected to compare favourably with last year's consolidated result of 2,939.6 million,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Current income was also expected to be higher than in 1995, it said.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
